{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/agent/edit_result_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:11:28.968517Z","id":"24c101ecb8a7552b18b05207fde9d6b95df982b6922f2f0384c35d87deeb3417","body":{"detail":"The walk checks additionalProperties: false and required == properties on every object. The Messages API also refuses minLength/maxLength, minimum/maximum/multipleOf, minItems other than 0 or 1, maxItems, and formats outside its list, and caps parameters with union types (anyOf or type arrays) at 16 and optional parameters at 24 per request. editSchema meets all of these today (three anyOf parameters, none optional); a test that allows only the supported keywords and counts anyOf nodes would stop a later edit (for example a maxLength on path) from making every Messages API request a 400.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":292},"end":{"line":320},"content_hash":"d65309e1d238e1a7ca47e7e6e5a890848cd2f7e31599203d51d22635841022ce"},"summary":"Pin the schema to the structured-outputs subset, not only additionalProperties and required","tags":["review","tests","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/agent/messages_api_backend_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:15:50.982789Z","id":"e63d1f0b83a2a6331fa6b64ff9f15ffc16578c5f0a63c1f2e520bfdbfffd2975","body":{"detail":"The test checks only the 'too long' text. run() makes it non-retryable (lib/agent/messages_api_backend.dart:170-175) on purpose, since sending the same request again stops at the same cap; nothing pins that.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":175},"end":{"line":179},"content_hash":"07a08bb48b9ec9f9f7986fc9e5b13b5f813ee475c0207aa4c0febdbd272f2cc8"},"summary":"Assert that a max_tokens stop is not retryable","tags":["review","tests","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/agent/edit_result_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:15:54.618257Z","id":"d75468d2ee05a6622ae628bbd96a256716585e9cd80046ce9a5c2065ddef3785","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:d03c23b7","summary":"Test 'the schema uses only keywords structured outputs accept' allows only type, properties, required, additionalProperties, items, enum, anyOf and description, refuses type arrays and optional properties, and counts 3 anyOf nodes (at most 16). `flutter test test/agent/edit_result_test.dart test/agent/prompt_test.dart` (apps/clax_app): +23, All tests passed; the same tests against the fd9a5db4 sources: +18 -5.","supersedes":"24c101ecb8a7552b18b05207fde9d6b95df982b6922f2f0384c35d87deeb3417","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/agent/messages_api_backend_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:18:56.605519Z","id":"1ab56927ed0240e334c3143e4e81da2f651d7de6393c78c5de16f96190652314","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:01203e52","summary":"The max_tokens test now asserts retryable is false, one request sent and no delay ('stop_reason max_tokens is a non-retryable AgentError saying too long, sent once'); it passes.","supersedes":"e63d1f0b83a2a6331fa6b64ff9f15ffc16578c5f0a63c1f2e520bfdbfffd2975","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
